{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー終わりましたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ったー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の夏が終わりましたね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2015\n来てくださったみなさん\n本当に本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそくレポ書きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長くなりそうなので分割しますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、神宮以外のレポ書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-オープニング映像-\nOverture\n太陽ノック\n走れ！Bicycle\nおいでシャンプー\n制服のマネキン\n-MC-\n羽根の記憶\n魚たちのLOVE SONG"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無表情\n別れ際、もっと好きになる\n命は美しい\n世界で一番 孤独なLover\n-MC-\n-アンダー映像-\n君は僕と会わない方がよかったのかな\n扇風機"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛を\n-MC(アンダー)-\n-べマーズ映像-\n太陽ノック(ストンプ)\n月の大きさ\n会いたかったかもしれない\nもう少しの夢\n-MC(胸キュン選手権)-\n-乃木坂らしさ映像-\n-生田ピアノソロ-\n何度目の青空か？\n君の名は希望\n-MC(乃木坂ニュース)-\nあらかじめ語られるロマンス"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服を脱いでサヨナラを"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無口なライオン\nせっかちなかたつむり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"革命の馬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その先の出口\nここにいる理由"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたままで\nガールズルール\n夏のFree&Easy\nぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレッタ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら片想い\n-MC(生駒)-\n悲しみの忘れ方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[アンコール]\nハウス！\nそんなバカな・・・"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"転がった鐘を鳴らせ\nロマンティックいか焼き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロマンスのスタート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンケシェーン\n-MC-\n乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎公演違ったから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←これで区切りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニングやアンダーコーナーの前の映像を作っていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演によって映像はほぼ違いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニング映像\nアンダー映像"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎宮城1公演目\n十福神(玲香)\nきいちゃん・未央奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎宮城2\nえりか様、生駒ちゃん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん、なーちゃん、ななみん(玲香)\nひめたん・愛未"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎愛知1\n若月(真夏)\nちーちゃん・らりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎愛知2\n飛鳥(かずみん)\nかりん・純奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎愛知3\nまいまい(まいまいママ)\n琴子・中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎広島1\nさゆにゃん(まりちゃ)\nひめたん・まあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎広島2\nまりちゃ(さゆにゃん)\nあーちゃん・らんぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎広島3\nかずみん(なーちゃん)\nひめたん・まあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎福岡1\nみなみ(えりか様)\nかわたん・伊織"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎福岡2\nみさみさ(みさみさママ)\nらりん・愛未"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎福岡3\n真夏(真夏パパ)\n琴子・未央奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎大阪1\nみさみさ(ゆったん)\nろってぃー・ひなちま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎大阪2\nまいちゅん(まいまい)\nちーちゃん・みり愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎大阪3\nさゆりん(まいやん)\nろってぃー・ひなちま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCは日替わりで担当しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーMCは\n福岡1でサブ回し\n宮城1名古屋1広島1福岡2大阪2でメイン回し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸キュン選手権は\n広島3でやりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡のMCで言ってた公約通り\n最近はみり愛に塩対応をされてます(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも結構好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べマーズコーナーでは\nべマーズとポラリスの2つに別れて\nストンプというものに初挑戦しました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポラリスの衣装着れて嬉しかった！\n可愛いよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？と君の名は希望は\nストリングスの方々と\nえりか様のピアノで歌いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えりか様かっこよかったな～\nおつかれさま(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の一番の思い出は宮城2公演目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日当日にライブできたこと\nそして、みなさんに祝ってもらったこと\nあと、大きなケーキも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/01/8876268/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}